= define chunk
+   term 数据块

= define chunk
-   definition
+   definition

-       One of the pieces in which a stream delivers its data, such as a block of bytes. Code
-       which reads a stream must allow for a boundary, such as the end of a line, falling between
-       two chunks.
+       流交付数据时所分成的各个片段之一，例如一个字节块。
+       读取流的代码必须考虑到行尾之类的边界落在两个数据块之间的情况。

